## 1. Core Platform Metrics (v2.0 Gates)

These KPIs must pass before v2.0 can be considered release-ready.

| KPI ID | Metric | Description | Verification Method | Target | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **KPI-2-001** | Donation Completion Rate | End-to-end donation flow from marketplace browse to payment success | XCUITest + Analytics | ≥ 85% | Pending |
| **KPI-2-002** | Campaign Creation Success | Creator completes campaign creation flow without errors | XCUITest | ≥ 90% | Pending |
| **KPI-2-003** | Verification Processing Time | Time from creator submission to admin decision | Admin dashboard timestamp audit | < 48 hours (avg) | Pending |
| **KPI-2-004** | Tax Receipt Generation | 80G receipt PDF generated for every completed donation | Integration test + DB audit | 100% | Pending |
| **KPI-2-005** | Recurring Subscription Setup | Subscription creation and first charge success rate | Integration test | ≥ 95% | Pending |

