## 4. Security Metrics (Strict Gates)

| KPI ID | Metric | Description | Verification Method | Target | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **KPI-2-041** | Zero PCI Data Stored | No payment card/UPI data in database or app | Code review + DB audit | 0 instances | Pending |
| **KPI-2-042** | RLS Enabled (All Tables) | Row Level Security blocks unauthorized access on all new tables | API test (anonymous) | All tables protected | Pending |
| **KPI-2-043** | Creator Data Isolation | Creator can only view/edit their own campaigns | RLS policy test | Zero cross-access | Pending |
| **KPI-2-044** | Admin Role Enforcement | Admin-only actions blocked for non-admin users | XCUITest + API test | 100% blocked | Pending |
| **KPI-2-045** | Document Upload Security | Uploaded files scanned for type; no executable uploads | Edge Function validation | Reject non-document files | Pending |
| **KPI-2-046** | Receipt Integrity | Generated receipts cannot be tampered with | Hash verification | Tamper-proof | Pending |
| **KPI-2-047** | Subscription Auth | Only the subscription owner can cancel | RLS policy test | 100% enforced | Pending |

